    private static IEnumerable<HyperlibWizardHeaderElementViewModel> Elements(HyperlibWizardHeaderLayoutViewModel layout){IEnumerable<HyperlibWizardHeaderElementViewModel> Visit(IEnumerable<HyperlibWizardHeaderElementViewModel> items){foreach(var item in items){yield return item;foreach(var child in Visit(item.Children))yield return child;}}return layout.Blocks.SelectMany(block=>Visit(block.Elements));}
    private static T Bound<T>(DependencyObject root,DependencyProperty property,object source,string path)where T:FrameworkElement=>Descendants<T>(root).First(control=>BindingOperations.GetBindingExpression(control,property)?.ParentBinding is{} binding&&ReferenceEquals(binding.Source,source)&&binding.Path?.Path==path);
    private static T Named<T>(FrameworkElement root,string name)where T:class=>root.FindName(name)as T??throw new InvalidOperationException("Missing "+name);
    private static IEnumerable<T> Descendants<T>(DependencyObject root)where T:DependencyObject{for(var index=0;index<VisualTreeHelper.GetChildrenCount(root);index++){var child=VisualTreeHelper.GetChild(root,index);if(child is T typed)yield return typed;foreach(var nested in Descendants<T>(child))yield return nested;}}
    private static void Check(Receipt receipt,bool condition,string message){if(!condition)throw new InvalidOperationException(message);receipt.Assertions.Add(message);}
    private static void Layout(FrameworkElement view,Size size){view.Width=size.Width;view.Height=size.Height;view.Measure(size);view.Arrange(new Rect(new Point(),size));view.UpdateLayout();view.Dispatcher.Invoke(()=>{},DispatcherPriority.ApplicationIdle);view.UpdateLayout();}
    private static void Render(FrameworkElement view,string path,Size size,Receipt receipt){Layout(view,size);var bitmap=new RenderTargetBitmap((int)size.Width,(int)size.Height,96,96,PixelFormats.Pbgra32);bitmap.Render(view);var encoder=new PngBitmapEncoder();encoder.Frames.Add(BitmapFrame.Create(bitmap));using var file=File.Create(path);encoder.Save(file);receipt.Renders.Add(path);}
    private static Task RunStaAsync(Func<Task> action){var completion=new TaskCompletionSource(TaskCreationOptions.RunContinuationsAsynchronously);var thread=new Thread(()=>{var dispatcher=Dispatcher.CurrentDispatcher;SynchronizationContext.SetSynchronizationContext(new DispatcherSynchronizationContext(dispatcher));dispatcher.BeginInvoke(async()=>{try{await action();completion.TrySetResult();}catch(Exception error){completion.TrySetException(error);}finally{dispatcher.BeginInvokeShutdown(DispatcherPriority.Background);}});Dispatcher.Run();}){IsBackground=true,Name="Body slots and Footer native acceptance"};thread.SetApartmentState(ApartmentState.STA);thread.Start();return completion.Task;}
    private static void LoadResources(string repository){if(Application.Current is not null)return;XNamespace presentation="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation";var source=XDocument.Load(Path.Combine(repository,"src/Hypershell/App.xaml")).Root!;var dictionary=new XElement(presentation+"ResourceDictionary",source.Attributes().Where(attribute=>attribute.IsNamespaceDeclaration).Select(attribute=>new XAttribute(attribute)),source.Element(presentation+"Application.Resources")!.Elements().Select(element=>new XElement(element)));foreach(var attribute in dictionary.DescendantsAndSelf().Attributes().Where(attribute=>attribute.IsNamespaceDeclaration))if(attribute.Value.StartsWith("clr-namespace:Hypershell",StringComparison.Ordinal)&&!attribute.Value.Contains(";assembly=",StringComparison.Ordinal))attribute.Value+=";assembly=Hypershell";foreach(var element in dictionary.DescendantsAndSelf())if(element.Name.NamespaceName.StartsWith("clr-namespace:Hypershell",StringComparison.Ordinal)&&!element.Name.NamespaceName.Contains(";assembly=",StringComparison.Ordinal))element.Name=XName.Get(element.Name.LocalName,element.Name.NamespaceName+";assembly=Hypershell");dictionary.Descendants().Attributes("Click").Remove();new Application{ShutdownMode=ShutdownMode.OnExplicitShutdown,Resources=(ResourceDictionary)XamlReader.Parse(dictionary.ToString())};}
